{"title": "缓存键无用户要素：串缓存现场", "lines": [
  {"t": "note", "s": "缓存键简化为 $request_method$request_uri，无用户要素"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -sD - -H 'Cookie: alice' http://localhost/item2 | grep X-Proxy"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "X-Proxy-Cache: MISS"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "alice 首次请求 MISS，属于正常回源"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -sD - -H 'Cookie: bob' http://localhost/item2 | grep X-Proxy"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "X-Proxy-Cache: HIT"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "bob 首次请求直接 HIT：读到的是 alice 的缓存"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx:alpine 容器 (nginx/1.31.5)"}
]}
